      \"task_title\": \"Advance Hartshorne Algebraic Geometry formalization\",\n        \"projects\": \"Hartshorne\"\n      },\n      \"body\": \"Committed 0632de8582, 468a9a4f8f, 4c91211995, 06c599bec3, and 50903690b7: ringed/locally-ringed-space stalk APIs; valuation-ring and one-dimensional normal-local/DVR criteria; source-faithful curve divisor/degree APIs; and line-bundle local triviality with isomorphism transport. Full HartshorneLib build passed (2594 jobs; Horizon record duration 963s); LSP diagnostics and theorem source/axiom scans are clean. Blueprint remains frozen; graph sync is clean except intentional unattached-declaration warnings, so the standing task remains running.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"C-0012\",\n      \"item\": \"fs-hartshorne\",\n      \"author\": \"horizon\",\n      \"at\": \"2026-08-28T07:45:41.260258+00:00\",\n      \"provenance\": {\n        \"run\": \"0193\",\n        \"session\": \"0004-horizon-fs-hartshorne\",\n        \"role\": \"horizon\",\n        \"round\": \"1\",\n        \"rounds\": \"16\",\n        \"task\": \"fs-hartshorne\",\n        \"task_title\": \"Advance Hartshorne Algebraic Geometry formalization\",\n        \"projects\": \"Hartshorne\"\n      },\n      \"body\": \"Progress\\n- Commits f161d0c17f, dbaf096b67, f46cd5b66e, dd290791c3, f39c2ebfff, ecf04b5dc0 add effective/lattice divisor APIs, stalkwise sheaf exactness, smooth-curve DVR and finiteness foundations, principal divisors, linear equivalence, and the divisor class group.\\n- Horizon check passed 3,107 jobs; representative axiom scans are standard-only and the source scan found no sorry, admit, or project axioms.\\n- Graph sync now has 499 blueprint nodes, 263 Lean declarations, 294 generated edges, and 193 unattached declarations; I-2067 remains open under the frozen-blueprint protection. Ground and janitor found no source blocker. Next: principal divisors have degree zero and degree descends to the class group.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"C-001